{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6bbf243b5a87583ade828120d1c1e9924f20f22ba8c079543ab9e1255b12129f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F2c0b9109039465f63fbdc7f614cccdeb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p><strong>摘要</strong></p><p>Gentle Monster 於 New York 率先預覽包含 16 款單品的智能眼鏡系列。與 Google 及 Samsung 聯合研發，重僅 40 克的鏡框集成了 Gemini AI 與 1200 萬像素鏡頭。售價由 $449 美元起，該系列將於 12 月 10 日公開發售。</p><p>Gentle Monster 將於 2026 年 11 月 13 日至 23 日期間，在紐約 23 Wall Street 舉行公眾預覽，首次公開展示其完整的智能眼鏡系列。</p><p></p><p>展覽透過<a href=\"https://www.gentlemonster.com/us/en/member/signin?callbackUrl=%2Fbook%3Fcode%3DIE-NY-261029%26srsltid%3DAYCX9vJ9ZAwdZgAHaiF2QnhTyIyyqomhLhyB3jpNmrfyTMMCoDgVHl5j\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網上登記</a>開放予公眾參與，這標誌著大眾首次有機會親身接觸這個首爾眼鏡品牌首度推出的可穿戴科技系列。有別於將鏡框視作傳統消費電子產品展示，Gentle Monster 透過沉浸式的畫廊風格展覽介紹這 16 款光學及太陽眼鏡系列，彰顯品牌在先鋒零售裝置及實驗性美學方面的聲譽。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7979a84151c96b95f36c6af2c4834173e2ea2f860e0c52a0cb517e7cc4b8502d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F5cd14230311d0fe13acc6685f347656d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f0c55e80705aa8d0b219e8660c4f9f87566b9aef830a5b6f9356bb4af546e0e5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F8457401227acf13ff1eae01283607ba8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9a96cc378169c84ebd744904713aef246bc781f7007c34e1f0ad415ca6673169/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F476f2189ae4b983675b2578fd1d0c9b9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/82baa0511ed54096dc91890970dac2496fa67e3e20ecaa4237545bde68b7efb0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2Ff87461214089a59df0a3479bd0d56f09.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8e6fcdf5d43d3f23eb54883e43ac86e8ba4718e265533c842950dd3118297765/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F90f300b9fbb0640e561784ec754d6ad2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6dc1daff30638cc02576bb16dac692a4e2973745d8ef90396731f36699bcafea/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2Fa89971a48e8a061687d4a104675831ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e928d97259e7cd3e36f6807e5f4a8794c9dfa6ff8e5132588ff0cc6c22d01193/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F9f4dba3dc843e0a96773c0070e542fb9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1a25e1c833fbd74c5f7d822194844b2ebbb69e5b4f3c24658b8893f6da99b544/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F07ba16fa6cdd6a844f497e4b1e5e8bd6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9ffa37e616c9d673c3a0de98b7fc5f204a4c8719599fd7675f3af34c15015b4f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2F55d162bbe95de3f1a67ab52c68cb1ca2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/221add7b06e47cbfd3bc9c86b47fe43fec1a8aa6126185d85903e212fb14e6a4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fhypebeast_634%2Ff6ebe5977356d0a52d9503b7476cdb89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Gentle Monster 完整智能眼鏡系列紐約首次公開預覽 Samsung Google</figcaption></figure><p>這個與 Google 及 Samsung 共同研發的系列包含六款鏡框：兩款光學眼鏡及四款太陽眼鏡，提供 16 種顏色與鏡片的組合。鏡框形狀體現了品牌的雕塑感設計語言：俐落的方形、流暢的輪廓、銳利的直線結構、優美的弧線以及粗獷的橢圓形。</p><p>系列以黑色醋酸纖維為主調，同時提供灰色、粉紅色、深紅色及黃色選擇。科技元素被巧妙地隱藏起來，佩戴者可以透過語音與 Google 的 AI 助理 Gemini 對話，眼鏡亦可與 Android 和 iOS 手機配對。每副眼鏡重約 40 克，單次充電可使用長達 9 小時，配合充電盒則可達 72 小時。</p><p>Gentle Monster 智能眼鏡系列將於 12 月 10 日正式發售，並在美國及韓國的<a href=\"https://www.gentlemonster.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gentle Monster</a>獨家發售，定價由 $449 至 $489 美元不等。</p><p><a href=\"https://hypebeast.com/zh/2026/11/gentle-monster-full-intelligent-eyewear-collection-new-york-city-first-time-public-preview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to view full gallery at Hypebeast</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:39:52.655151+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1245,"images":11,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:06:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:36:35.717831+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:33:21.879076+00:00","content_hash":"2f07055102ff66600da084c7f1694668f71878f4169d06b8882dde8f7186ef27","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}